{"id":"762abc58e37c6f85","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-local-reflection.md","title":"Local Reflection Principle $\\mathrm{rfn} G$","display":"df-local-reflection — Local Reflection Principle $\\mathrm{rfn}_G$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-local-reflection","aliases":["92-df-local-reflection"],"display":"df-local-reflection — Local Reflection Principle $\\mathrm{rfn}_G$","depends_on":["[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-numeral]]"],"source":"本地反射与相容性进展扩展；对照原书第 IX 章 pp.106–110 的 HBL/Löb 背景；该 PDF 不定义这些完整模式或 Turing 进展","source_status":"原书之外的证明论扩展"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-local-reflection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-local-reflection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-local-reflection — Local Reflection Principle <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{rfn}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{rfn}_G\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地反射与相容性进展扩展；对照原书第 IX 章 pp.106–110 的 HBL/Löb 背景；该 PDF 不定义这些完整模式或 Turing 进展"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书之外的证明论扩展"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (internal provability-formula constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> (numeral for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{rfn}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{rfn}_G\\)</span> (definition-target local-reflection constructor)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}reflection} \\vdash \\mathrm{rfn}_G(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\\bigr)\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}reflection} \\vdash \\mathrm{rfn}_G(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\\bigr)\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{rfn}_G(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{rfn}_G(\\varphi)\\)</span>是句子<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>的一条局部反射实例，而不是外部真值判断</li>\n<li>它在对象语言中表示“若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>可证<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>”；把该句作为新公理与在元语言中声称它为真是不同层次</li>\n<li>取固定矛盾句时，该实例与内部一致性句密切相关；一般的局部反射实例不能统称为同一个一致性陈述</li>\n<li>用于分析系统G的元理论性质</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G$ (sentence, see [[92-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (internal provability-formula constructor, see [[92-df-provability-predicate]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ (Gödel numbering, see [[92-df-godel-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\bar n$ (numeral for $n$, see [[92-df-numeral]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{rfn}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{rfn}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}reflection} \\vdash \\mathrm{rfn}_G(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\\bigr)\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{rfn}_G(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1692,"backlinks":[{"id":"1ea2ee34667cb5dd","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{rfn}_G$ (local-reflection constructor, see [[92-df-local-reflection]])"},{"id":"2e79b6767e33bac3","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{rfn}_G$ (local-reflection constructor, see [[92-df-local-reflection]])"},{"id":"d671aa63fca8d973